# Craw Giant (6/4, Trample) attacks; Devoted Hero (1/2) blocks. The Giant
# assigns exactly lethal (2) to the Hero and tramples the rest (4) over to
# the defending player -- CR 702.19b, computed automatically since a single
# blocker is never itself a decision (lethalDamage, combatdamage.go).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance so the state-based-action check moves the lethally
# damaged Hero to the graveyard.
advance
